      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780733159079,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Low Latency: \n    - adding a cache for metadata lookup \n    - CDN for fast retrieval of content \n2) Availability: \n    - horizontal scaling \n3) Handling Spikes \n    - Although the current solution works fine but in a hypothetical scenario\nof spikes are there in write requests then we use EDA via kafka\n4) Handling Large Files: \n    - We use predesigned URLs from S3 and chunking to support this. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Low Latency: \n    - adding a cache for metadata lookup \n    - CDN for fast retrieval of content \n2) Availability: \n    - horizontal scaling \n3) Handling Spikes \n    - Although the current solution works fine but in a hypothetical scenario of spikes are there in write requests then we use EDA via kafka\n4) Handling Large Files: \n    - We use predesigned URLs from S3 and chunking to support this. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
